        },
        "quote": "(a) In determining whether diversion of a defendant is in the interests of justice and of benefit to the defendant and the community, the City Attorney shall consider at least the following factors among all factors considered:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.490 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "7a0a79be-8c67-5917-b3d5-576c641cb161",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 301,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:1",
          "start": 228
        },
        "quote": "(1) The nature of the crime charged and the circumstances surrounding it;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.490 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "92542f39-6f9b-5c53-a247-66e47d2687f3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 368,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:2",
          "start": 302
        },
        "quote": "(2) Any special characteristics or circumstances of the defendant;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.490 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "abf71261-0d3a-5948-96ac-b119a73565e6",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 607,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:3",
          "start": 369
        },
        "quote": "(3) Whether the defendant is a first-time offender of an alcohol-related offense and if the defendant has previously participated in diversion, according to the certification of the Division of Vehicles of the State Department of Revenue;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.490 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "abf435f8-552d-5b93-bdf0-91f8c94fa788",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 709,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:4",
          "start": 608
        },
        "quote": "(4) Whether there is a probability that the defendant will cooperate with and benefit from diversion;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.490 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "39560af8-9fc4-559e-bd07-88f201735556",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 799,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:5",
          "start": 710
        },
        "quote": "(5) Whether the available diversion program is appropriate to the needs of the defendant;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.490 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "32de5416-5c54-5c82-a221-876430512337",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 868,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:6",
          "start": 800
        },
        "quote": "(6) The impact of the diversion of the defendant upon the community;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.490 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "cd3cb664-1bbd-543a-890c-128c5311778a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 937,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:7",
          "start": 869
        },
        "quote": "(7) Recommendations, if any, of the involved law enforcement agency;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.490 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "8bd20837-b6ad-589b-8fba-535eee6b259c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 981,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:8",
          "start": 938
        },
        "quote": "(8) Recommendations, if any, of the victim;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.490 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "0705b61b-610f-5459-b382-eaa809359efe",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1017,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:9",
          "start": 982
        },
        "quote": "(9) Provisions for restitution; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
