          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:10",
          "start": 1018
        },
        "quote": "(10) Any mitigating circumstances.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.490 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "4c18d3e5-19ad-5882-988a-8c17fa2007d0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1226,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:11",
          "start": 1053
        },
        "quote": "(b) The City Attorney shall not enter into a diversion agreement in lieu of further criminal proceedings on a complaint alleging an alcohol-related offense if the defendant:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.490 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "e29cd64c-c241-583e-a653-591b1f66c25a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1302,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:12",
          "start": 1227
        },
        "quote": "(1) Has previously participated in diversion of an alcohol-related offense;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.490 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "4efc2a21-4798-5a32-9408-6a14ab31f2e9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1653,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:13",
          "start": 1303
        },
        "quote": "(2) Has previously been convicted of or pleaded nolo contendere to an alcohol-related offense in this State or has previously been convicted of or pleaded nolo contendere to a violation of K.S.A. 8-1567 and amendments thereto or of a law of another state, or of a political subdivision thereof, which prohibits the acts prohibited by that statute; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.490 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "2fe5c801-2ed7-5701-b75e-d26483a5ebb7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1897,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:14",
          "start": 1654
        },
        "quote": "(3) During the time of the alleged alcohol-related offense was involved in a motor vehicle accident or collision resulting in personal injury or death. (Ord. 20206 § 9, 9-10-19; Ord. 17666 § 51, 3-27-01. Code 1995 § 50-86. Formerly 2.110.490.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.490:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
